OL,3,APlans to evacuate hundreds of homes in
OL,4,AFalmouth over unexploded WW2 bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FGWR suspends train services between
OL,7,FFalmouth Docks and Falmouth Town
OL,8,Fstations
OL,10,FSuperintendent Ian Thompson, from Devon
OL,11,Fand Cornwall Police, previously warned:
OL,12,F"If the cordon is extended and you live
OL,13,Fwithin this area, you are strongly
OL,14,Furged to leave your home by 09:00 BST
